CORE
main.c
--datarace --no-assertions --no-por --unwind 2 --rounds 3 --index-chain --allow-pointer-unsoundness
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^index chain: [1-9][0-9]* of
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The race between the two plain writes of x is found with the chain of x
carrying the index of the last write instead of its value. The index chain only
applies from three rounds on, hence --rounds 3; the "index chain:" line shows
it was used.
